<title>PHILIPPINES: DMCI Holdings 9-mth net 880.361 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>DMCI Holdings 9-mth net 880.361 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction firm DMCI Holdings Inc reported on Thursday a net income of 880.361 million pesos for the first nine months of 1996.</p>
</text>
